! ------------------------------------------------------------------
! Eco-Loop Building Agents - runtime policy snapshot
! Policy #2  installed at simulation hour 4399.00
! Source: agent
! Rationale: Occupied PMV of -0.64 shows the building is too cold, so the cooling setpoint is raised 3.5 C. This cuts cooling energy and moves comfort toward neutral at the same time.
!
! Occupied setpoints written into Schedule:Constant objects and wired
! into each zone's ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint:
!   CORE_ZN            heating 20.00 C   cooling 25.50 C
!   PERIMETER_ZN_1     heating 20.00 C   cooling 25.50 C
!   PERIMETER_ZN_2     heating 20.00 C   cooling 25.50 C
!   PERIMETER_ZN_3     heating 20.00 C   cooling 25.50 C
!   PERIMETER_ZN_4     heating 20.00 C   cooling 25.50 C
!
! Note: unoccupied setback and precool are applied at runtime by the
! reflex controller and are not representable in a constant schedule.
! ------------------------------------------------------------------
